# OKX / 欧意 Surge RULE-SET
# Generated from actual Surge traffic captured on 2026-10-06.
# Scope: OKX.app core traffic + verified/functional supporting endpoints.
# Rule-set lines intentionally do not contain a policy.

# macOS: catch the OKX main process and helper processes.
# Surge iOS ignores PROCESS-NAME rules, so domain rules below are also included.
PROCESS-NAME,OKX*

# Official / first-party OKX infrastructure
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okx.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coinall.ltd
DOMAIN,okg-pub-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com

# Observed OKX application service endpoints in this capture
# Exact-host rules are used because parent-domain ownership was not independently verified.
DOMAIN,okexweb.qqhrss.com
DOMAIN,wspri.gihiji.com

# Functional third-party services observed from OKX
DOMAIN,dkapi-ga.geetest.com
DOMAIN,www.tradingview-widget.com

# Intentionally NOT domain-routed here:
# mc.yandex.ru       - analytics/telemetry; shared by unrelated apps/sites
# stun.l.google.com  - public Google STUN; shared infrastructure and UDP-specific
